   "he": "דָּבָר אַחֵר: ״לֹא תְחׇנֵּם״ — לֹא תִּתֵּן לָהֶם חֵן. מְסַיַּיע לֵיהּ לְרַב, דְּאָמַר רַב: אָסוּר לָאָדָם שֶׁיֹּאמַר ״כַּמָּה נָאָה גּוֹיָה זוֹ״.",
   "en": "§ It is taught in the baraita cited earlier: «Another matter: “You should not show them favor”;» this teaches that «you should not give them favor» by praising them. The Gemara notes that this «supports» the opinion of «Rav. As Rav says: It is prohibited for a person to say: How beautiful is this gentile woman!»"
